{"synopsis":"Anak laki-laki Korea, Lee Jian, yang dibebaskan dari tim muda bergengsi di Italia, menghabiskan hari-harinya bermalas-malasan sebagai pemain pengganti bahkan setelah tiba di tim muda AC Firenze, seolah-olah dia sedang melarikan diri, seperti biasa, dia menyombongkan diri pada teman masa kecilnya, Kim Jiwoo, mengaku sebagai seorang jenius, tetapi kemudian dia mendengar berita mengejutkan bahwa Jiwoo akan datang ke Italia untuk belajar di luar negeri. Bertekad untuk tidak mengecewakan temannya yang berharga, Jiwoo, Jian bertekad untuk menjadi starter","alternative_title":"축구천재로 오해받는 중입니다, I'm Mistaken for a Soccer Genius","author":"Han Myeong Hyeon","artist":"Ivote","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"70f6f4ac-7a8e-484b-975a-65e0f69e8ff1","number":"85","chapter":"85","title":"Chapter 85","date":"2026-07-20","released":"2026-07-20","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"a7e91bdb-68f5-435b-952b-c7b6b1a4095c","number":"84","chapter":"84","title":"Chapter 84","date":"2026-07-17","released":"2026-07-17","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"36bdf77f-3679-46ec-a83c-7d136b2c5b1e","number":"83","chapter":"83","title":"Chapter 83","date":"2026-07-06","released":"2026-07-06","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"f0033fc3-cf75-4df0-b4d3-4e122cf5c691","number":"82","chapter":"82","title":"Chapter 82","date":"2026-07-02","released":"2026-07-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"fea1be90-620c-4414-89bf-b8e0d658d062","number":"81","chapter":"81","title":"Chapter 81","date":"2026-06-30","released":"2026-06-30","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"3ec21153-2bae-4912-8fb7-a427c3478b57","number":"80","chapter":"80","title":"Chapter 80","date":"2026-06-10","released":"2026-06-10","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"a11f654d-f251-44a8-a0e9-f953435a6b61","number":"79","chapter":"79","title":"Chapter 79","date":"2026-06-08","released":"2026-06-08","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"81686df7-1604-446d-8559-7d081758c112","number":"78","chapter":"78","title":"Chapter 78","date":"2026-06-08","released":"2026-06-08","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"0037475